  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3305.01 Hearing. After investigation, if the department determines that an agency does not comply with RSA 205-C or these rules, the department shall notify the agency and a hearing shall be scheduled with the bureau of hearings of the department of safety.\n\nSource. #5439, eff 7-24-92; ss by #6810, INTERIM, eff 7-25-98, EXPIRES: 11-22-98; ss by #6885, eff 11-18-98;ss by #8741, INTERIM, eff 11-18-06, EXPIRED: 5-17-07\n\nNew. #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19",
